{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# DeepSeek-V4 通用系统底座\n3.1-3.4 工程主线","x":80,"y":40,"width":500,"height":110,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 1｜MoE 专家并行\n- token 路由到不同专家\n- Dispatch / Combine 通信重\n- GPU 容易等待通信","x":80,"y":230,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p1","type":"text","text":"◇\n**wave scheduling**\n通信计算重叠","x":535,"y":320,"width":190,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 2｜专家流水线\n- 专家拆成多个 wave\n- 到达一批就计算一批\n- 隐藏通信延迟","x":760,"y":230,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p2","type":"text","text":"◇\n**TileLang**\n融合复杂算子","x":1215,"y":320,"width":180,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 3｜高性能 kernel\n- Host Codegen 降低调用开销\n- SMT 分析复杂索引\n- 默认保持数值严格","x":1430,"y":230,"width":450,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"p3","type":"text","text":"◇\n**BI + deterministic**\n固定计算路径","x":1985,"y":320,"width":210,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 4｜可复现 kernel 库\n- batch 组合不改变 token 输出\n- 重复运行结果一致\n- 避免非确定性 atomicAdd","x":2240,"y":230,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p4","type":"text","text":"◇\n**FP4 QAT**\n提前适应量化","x":2370,"y":585,"width":185,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 5｜低精度执行\n- MoE expert weights 使用 FP4\n- CSA indexer QK path 使用 FP4\n- rollout / inference 使用真实 FP4","x":2240,"y":760,"width":460,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p5","type":"text","text":"◇\n**系统收益**\n速度 / 显存 / 稳定性","x":1980,"y":860,"width":210,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f","type":"text","text":"## 最终目标｜复杂模型可落地\n- MoE 跑得快\n- kernel 写得快\n- 结果可复现\n- 长上下文和低精度可部署","x":1430,"y":745,"width":450,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## 读图方式\n- 大卡片：工程问题 / 系统状态\n- 小卡片：关键技术动作\n- 上排解释从通信到 kernel\n- 下排解释从量化到落地","x":80,"y":760,"width":470,"height":240,"color":"6"}
